[en.FOCUS_C12_STRESS_LOYALTY]
Stress loyalty

[en.FOCUS_C12_STRESS_LOYALTY_desc]
To ensure that future wars are executed flawlessly, we must preemptively eliminate all unstable elements and potential traitors within the rock farm. Additionally, through the Bureau of Affairs’ relentless political propaganda, we must make every pony understand that only Pie family can lead them to defeat the Empire and bring about peace.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STRESS_LOYALTY]
强调对家族的忠诚

[zh.FOCUS_C12_STRESS_LOYALTY_desc]
为了确保未来的战争万无一失，需要提前清除采石农场内部所有的不稳定因素和潜在叛变者，并且通过事务局不间断的政治宣传让所有小马都明白，只有派家族才能带领他们击败帝国，带来和平。

